WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
Film Courage: Why do so many writers say that&nbsp;
outlining prevents them from being creative?

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.560
Naomi Beaty, Writer, Screenwriting Teacher&nbsp;
and Consultant: oh I think that I think a lot&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:15.120
of writers feel like if they outline to in too&nbsp;
detailed of a manner it will sort of force them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:20.160
into a corner when they're writing right they'll&nbsp;
have it too planned out it'll take the creativity&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:25.360
out of it it'll take that sort of spontaneity out&nbsp;
of their creative process or something like that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:33.280
I guess that's my that's my best guess that's&nbsp;
why some writers think that that outlining is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:39.280
stifling but I actually think that outlining the&nbsp;
the process of outlining your story like breaking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:45.680
your story and and forming the outline can be the&nbsp;
creative process right like that sort of creative&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:51.680
process that you look for when you're writing of&nbsp;
discovery and coming up with new ideas by kind&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:55.680
of juxtaposing things that you didn't expect&nbsp;
or whatever you can do that in the outlining&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.680 --> 00:01:01.280
process itself right and kind of have all of those&nbsp;
sparks of inspiration and creativity while you're&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:07.040
working in that in that format instead of in&nbsp;
on the page if that makes sense do you get a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:14.720
lot of pushback from writers who don't want&nbsp;
to outline not a ton I think it's probably&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:21.680
50/50 in terms of writers who like to outline&nbsp;
or at least have learned that it's more helpful&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:29.440
than than painful for them right and so there are&nbsp;
plenty of writers who embrace outlining as part&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:36.000
of their process and there but then there are also&nbsp;
writers who either feel like it's too stifling or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:43.520
don't really have a good process and so they stay&nbsp;
away from outlining or avoid it just because they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:50.080
