or what it how would this happen or why would this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:20.320 --> 00:07:26.240
happen and then when you sit down to kind of&nbsp;
figure out the whole story you realize oh the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:30.080
part that got me so excited and there's nothing&nbsp;
wrong with it at all but the part that gets us&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:36.160
excited is that set up it's that situation right&nbsp;
that interesting what if and then the rest of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:43.520
story is the part that you still have to figure&nbsp;
out so I think that that it's not that you it's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:47.920
not that you came up with an idea that you thought&nbsp;
was better than it actually is it's that you came&nbsp;&nbsp;

