I just didn't know how to put it into words and&nbsp;
I think that that was that's it it's that's like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.240 --> 00:08:14.400
the the setup is so vivid in our minds but then&nbsp;
actually having it pay off and there'll be an arc&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:20.240
yes and and a resolution to it I think that's yeah&nbsp;
yeah yeah because that's usually that's that spark&nbsp;&nbsp;

