of inspiration is we get inspired by that like oh&nbsp;
wouldn't it be funny if this happened or wouldn't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:31.120
it be like dramatic or scary if this happened&nbsp;
and that's all that act one setup stuff so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:36.000
what is your argument for writers to learn&nbsp;
